9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d9b1eb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8d9b1eb\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7682deb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7682deb\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10fe07a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"10fe07a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Introduction<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55d1c86 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"55d1c86\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>CamTech is a private, not-for-profit university established in 2021 with a mission to offer applied research and innovation-focused education to transform lives that respond to industrial development and socio-economic growth needs. Recognizing the importance of long-term financial stability and sustainability, the university has established t<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0em;\">he CamTech Endowment Fund<\/span> to ensure its ability to fulfill its mission and provide exceptional educational opportunities for generations to come.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a17588 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9a17588\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cdb403e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"cdb403e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cb9c1d9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cb9c1d9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8e9659 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c8e9659\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf712db elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"cf712db\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1279\" height=\"270\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Khmer-Chinese.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-33260\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Khmer-Chinese.jpg 1279w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Khmer-Chinese-300x63.jpg 300w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Khmer-Chinese-1024x216.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Khmer-Chinese-768x162.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1279px) 100vw, 1279px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4de7f4c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4de7f4c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8de6db9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8de6db9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c163e60 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c163e60\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c5d3d51 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c5d3d51\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c20321 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0c20321\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Purpose\u200b<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f3e3767 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f3e3767\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The purpose of the CamTech Endowment Fund is to provide a permanent source of income to support the university&#8217;s core mission and strategic priorities. This includes, but is not limited to:<br \/>\u2022 <strong>Financial aid<\/strong>: Providing scholarships and other financial assistance to deserving students.<br \/>\u2022 <strong>Academic programs<\/strong>: Supporting the development and enhancement of academic programs, faculty research, and educational resources.<br \/>\u2022 <strong>Infrastructure development<\/strong>: Funding for renovations, equipment upgrades, and new facilities (including student dormitory) to maintain a modern and conducive learning environment.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a8e4d8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3a8e4d8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4768e11 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4768e11\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a651a1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3a651a1\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29bf24a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"29bf24a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41631ca e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"41631ca\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bea839a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bea839a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Fund Management and Investment Strategy<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6545733 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6545733\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The CamTech Endowment Fund will be managed by a professional investment committee composed of individuals with expertise in financial management and investment strategies. The committee will develop and implement an investment strategy that aims to:<br \/>\u2022 <strong>Generate sustainable income<\/strong>: The investment portfolio will be diversified across different asset classes, such as equities, bonds, real estate, and alternative investments, to balance risk and potential return. This diversification will help to mitigate the impact of market volatility and provide a steady stream of income for the university.<br \/>\u2022 <strong>Preserve the principal<\/strong>: The committee will also prioritize the long-term preservation of the principal amount of the endowment fund. This is achieved by ensuring a portion of the portfolio <br \/>is invested in assets with lower risk profiles, even if they offer lower returns.<br \/>\u2022 <strong>Meet spending needs<\/strong>: The committee will establish a sustainable spending policy that determines the annual distribution amount from the endowment fund. This amount will be based on a rolling average of the market value of the fund to ensure long-term sustainability and avoid depleting the principal.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-816c48b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"816c48b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4c34c1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f4c34c1\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87443d6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"87443d6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6509502 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6509502\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9db7fcf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9db7fcf\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21a2fdb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"21a2fdb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Endowment Fund Management Flow Chart<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa06c5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"aa06c5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"469\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Endowment-Fund-Management-Flow-Chart-768x563.png\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-33996\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Endowment-Fund-Management-Flow-Chart-768x563.png 768w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Endowment-Fund-Management-Flow-Chart-300x220.png 300w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Endowment-Fund-Management-Flow-Chart.png 888w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-015d539 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"015d539\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29bb241 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"29bb241\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca379a3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ca379a3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db41c27 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"db41c27\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-115cf40 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"115cf40\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e3eaba5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e3eaba5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Invest in the CamTech Endowment Fund?<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35dd218 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"35dd218\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>By contributing to the CamTech Endowment Fund, you have the opportunity to make a lasting and transformative impact on the future of our university and the lives of countless students. Here are some reasons why you should consider investing in our endowment fund:<\/p><p><strong>Make a lasting impact<\/strong>: Your gift will become a permanent source of income for the university, supporting our mission and enhancing educational opportunities for generations of students to come.<\/p><p><strong>Invest in the future of Cambodia<\/strong>: By supporting CamTech, you are investing in the future of Cambodia by empowering its next generation of leaders and innovators.<\/p><p><strong>Support a diverse and talented student body<\/strong>: Your contribution will help us provide scholarships and financial aid to deserving students, regardless of their financial background, ensuring access to a high-quality education for all.<\/p><p><strong>Support academic excellence<\/strong>: Your investment will contribute to the development and enhancement of our academic programs, faculty research, and educational resources, fostering a vibrant learning environment and advancing knowledge creation.<\/p><p><strong>Be a part of a legacy<\/strong>: Your contribution will be recognized and celebrated, leaving a lasting legacy that will be remembered by future generations of students and faculty.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16f2598 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"16f2598\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n