Strategy The CamTech Endowment Fund will be managed by a professional investment committee composed of individuals with expertise in financial management and investment strategies. The committee will develop and implement an investment strategy that aims to:\u2022 Generate sustainable income: The investment portfolio will be diversified across different asset classes, such as equities, bonds, real estate, and alternative investments, to balance risk and potential return. This diversification will help to mitigate the impact of market volatility and provide a steady stream of income for the university.\u2022 Preserve the principal: The committee will also prioritize the long-term preservation of the principal amount of the endowment fund. This is achieved by ensuring a portion of the portfolio is invested in assets with lower risk profiles, even if they offer lower returns.\u2022 Meet spending needs: The committee will establish a sustainable spending policy that determines the annual distribution amount from the endowment fund. This amount will be based on a rolling average of the market value of the fund to ensure long-term sustainability and avoid depleting the principal. Endowment Fund Management Flow Chart Why Invest in the CamTech Endowment Fund? By contributing to the CamTech Endowment Fund, you have the opportunity to make a lasting and transformative impact on the future of our university and the lives of countless students. Here are some reasons why you should consider investing in our endowment fund: Make a lasting impact: Your gift will become a permanent source of income for the university, supporting our mission and enhancing educational opportunities for generations of students to come. Invest in the future of Cambodia: By supporting CamTech, you are investing in the future of Cambodia by empowering its next generation of leaders and innovators. Support a diverse and talented student body: Your contribution will help us provide scholarships and financial aid to deserving students, regardless of their financial background, ensuring access to a high-quality education for all. Support academic excellence: Your investment will contribute to the development and enhancement of our academic programs, faculty research, and educational resources, fostering a vibrant learning environment and advancing knowledge creation. Be a part of a legacy: Your contribution will be recognized and celebrated, leaving a lasting legacy that will be remembered by future generations of students and faculty. Donations The CamTech Endowment Fund welcomes tax-deductible donations from individuals, corporations, foundations, and other organizations. All donations will be used to grow the corpus of the fund and generate income to support the university&#8217;s mission. Recognition Donors to the CamTech Endowment Fund will be recognized appropriately based on the size and nature of their contributions. Recognition may include:\u2022 Listing in the university&#8217;s annual report and on the endowment fund website.\u2022 Naming opportunities for scholarships, endowed chairs, programs, or facilities established or supported by the donor&#8217;s contribution. Endowment Donors:\u200b Touch Sonn Foundation: US$300,000 \u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Beneficiary Account Name: CAMTECH-ENDOWMENT \u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Beneficiary Account Number: 0010006835649\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Beneficiary Address: CamTech Street, Sangkat Prek Tasek, Khan Chroy Chongvar Phnom Penh Phnom Penh, 121003\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Beneficiary Bank: CANADIA BANK PLC\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Beneficiary Bank Address No.315, Corner Street Ang Doung &amp; Monivong Blvd. Phnom Penh, Cambodia\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Beneficiary Bank SWIFT Code CADIKHPP\u00a0or\u00a0CADIKHPPXXX Pl